    {
      "source": "Provides HttpServletRequest and HttpServletResponse arguments instead of the\ndefault ServletRequest and ServletResponse ones.",
      "translation": "提供 HttpServletRequest 和 HttpServletResponse 参数，而不是默认的 ServletRequest 和 ServletResponse。",
